<title>UK: BRENT TRADES WEAKER AT SEPT BRENT -20 CTS - TRADE.</title>
<headline>BRENT TRADES WEAKER AT SEPT BRENT -20 CTS - TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent crude traded sharply weaker at a 20 cent discount to September Brent on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>The August 20-22 loader changed hands after being offered out aggressively in the afternoon by a British major at around September -15 cents.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom - 44 171 542 7646</p>
